
[TestRunPrintsSnapshotsHelp - 1]
Generate, compare, and update serialization snapshots

Usage:
  tck snapshots [flags]
  tck snapshots [command]

Available Commands:
  check       Check the snapshot set and stable snapshot contents
  sync        Synchronize snapshots from config.toml
  update      Adopt one upstream revision and update its snapshots

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for snapshots

Use "tck snapshots [command] --help" for more information about a command.

---
